{
  "id": "ep191",
  "duration": 51.524,
  "beats": [
    {
      "start": 0.08,
      "end": 4.562,
      "text": "Two dead stars smashed together and forged cosmic supplies of gold.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Eso1733s Artist's impression of merging neutron stars.jpg",
        "credit": "University of Warwick/Mark Garlick",
        "license": "CC BY 4.0",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Eso1733s_Artist%27s_impression_of_merging_neutron_stars.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 2.267,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        },
        {
          "start": 2.267,
          "end": 4.567,
          "kind": "detail",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 4.562,
      "end": 12.781,
      "text": "In 2017, observatories detected ripples in spacetime from a collision over 130 million light-years away.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "LIGO Hanford aerial 05.jpg",
        "credit": "LIGO Laboratory",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:LIGO_Hanford_aerial_05.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 4.567,
          "end": 7.667,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        },
        {
          "start": 7.667,
          "end": 12.767,
          "kind": "detail",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 12.781,
      "end": 21.351,
      "text": "Two ultra-dense neutron stars spiraled together, detonating a fireball roughly 1,000 times brighter than a classical nova.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Hubble observes first kilonova (37723717952).jpg",
        "credit": "Hubble ESA",
        "license": "CC BY 2.0",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hubble_observes_first_kilonova_(37723717952).jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 12.767,
          "end": 21.367,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 21.351,
      "end": 27.296,
      "text": "The violent crash unleashed a flood of neutrons, driving the rapid neutron-capture process.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Cataclysmic collision (eso1733v).tiff",
        "credit": "NSF/LIGO/Sonoma State University/A. Simonnet",
        "license": "CC BY 4.0",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cataclysmic_collision_(eso1733v).tiff"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 21.367,
          "end": 27.3,
          "kind": "cover",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 27.296,
      "end": 34.821,
      "text": "This extreme forge synthesized heavy elements like gold and uranium that normal stars cannot produce.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Artist\u2019s impression of strontium emerging from a neutron star merger.jpg",
        "credit": "ESO/L. Cal\u00e7ada/M. Kornmesser",
        "license": "CC BY 4.0",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Artist%E2%80%99s_impression_of_strontium_emerging_from_a_neutron_star_merger.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 27.3,
          "end": 30.6,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        },
        {
          "start": 30.6,
          "end": 34.833,
          "kind": "detail",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 34.821,
      "end": 40.366,
      "text": "These heavy elements blocked blue light, turning the expanding cloud a distinct glowing red.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Composite of images of NGC 4993 and kilonova (eso1733r).tiff",
        "credit": "ESO/N.R. Tanvir, A.J. Levan and the VIN-ROUGE collaboration",
        "license": "CC BY 4.0",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Composite_of_images_of_NGC_4993_and_kilonova_(eso1733r).tiff"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 34.833,
          "end": 37.6,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        },
        {
          "start": 37.6,
          "end": 40.367,
          "kind": "detail",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 40.366,
      "end": 47.041,
      "text": "Spectral models revealed the explosive debris fireball expanded as an almost perfect sphere.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "designed card"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 40.367,
          "end": 47.033,
          "kind": "designed",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 47.041,
      "end": 51.174,
      "text": "The heaviest metals in our cosmos required complete destruction.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Eso1733s Artist's impression of merging neutron stars.jpg",
        "credit": "University of Warwick/Mark Garlick",
        "license": "CC BY 4.0",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Eso1733s_Artist%27s_impression_of_merging_neutron_stars.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 47.033,
          "end": 51.533,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
